  "limitations": [
    "An HMAC fingerprint identifies an allocation by equality, not temporal ordering or execution authority. Delayed list responses use immutable per-session object baselines, not token ordering.",
    "Fresh403 poll failure still only records lastError; it does not itself clear existing private rows. Existing scope/authority removals and next fresh filtered list win. This preexisting policy is not changed or claimed fixed.",
    "Terminal state means process ended, not success, verified output, review, integration, cleanup or clean WebSocket closure.",
    "Legacy missing generation never automatically erases typed terminal evidence; explicit Retry attach is offered only for an ended attachment that has never acquired a trustworthy generation, with current authority and session not exited.",
    "Backend HMAC/HTTP/team projection receipts and additional tests are owned by parent in sibling directories; this manifest does not combine their pass counts.",
    "No app/build/provider/benchmark/window launched; no repository files written."
